{
  "groups": [
    {
      "title": "Welcome",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "include-script",
          "label": "Include Script",
          "icon": "code",
          "badge": "Step 1",
          "content": "# Include AIClient\n\nVoeg eerst de AIClient library toe via jsDelivr:\n\n```html\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/HyperRushNet/hrn-ai/client/1.0.3.min.js\"></script>\n```"
        },
        {
          "id": "init-client",
          "label": "Initialize Client",
          "icon": "play",
          "badge": "Step 2",
          "content": "# Initialize AIClient\n\nInitialiseer de client met je API key:\n\n```javascript\nconst client = new AIClient()\n  .setApiKey('YOUR_API_KEY');\n```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Text Generation",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "text-setup",
          "label": "Setup Text Mode",
          "icon": "file-text",
          "badge": "Step 3",
          "content": "# Text Mode\n\nKies dat je tekst wil genereren:\n\n```javascript\nclient.setType('text');\n```"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-model",
          "label": "Model Selection",
          "icon": "cpu",
          "badge": "Step 4",
          "content": "# Model (Text)\n\nGebruik een snelle text model:\n\n```javascript\nclient.setModel('gemini-fast');\n```"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-generate",
          "label": "Generate Text",
          "icon": "play-circle",
          "badge": "Core",
          "content": "# Generate Text\n\nGenereer output:\n\n```javascript\nconst result = await client.generate('Explain AIClient');\nconsole.log(result);\n```"
        },
        {
          "id": "text-options",
          "label": "Optional Settings",
          "icon": "sliders",
          "badge": "Optional",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "system-prompt",
              "label": "System Prompt",
              "icon": "edit-3",
              "content": "```javascript\nclient.setSystemPrompt('You are a helpful assistant');\n```"
            },
            {
              "id": "timeout",
              "label": "Timeout",
              "icon": "clock",
              "content": "```javascript\nclient.setTimeout(30000);\n```"
            },
            {
              "id": "seed",
              "label": "Seed",
              "icon": "shuffle",
              "content": "```javascript\nclient.setSeed(12345);\n```"
            },
            {
              "id": "retry",
              "label": "Retry",
              "icon": "refresh-cw",
              "content": "```javascript\nclient.setRetry(true, 2, 1000);\n```"
            },
            {
              "id": "clear-history",
              "label": "Clear History",
              "icon": "trash-2",
              "content": "```javascript\nclient.clearHistory();\n```"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Image Generation",
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "image-setup",
          "label": "Setup Image Mode",
          "icon": "image",
          "badge": "Step 3",
          "content": "# Image Mode\n\nKies dat je een image wil genereren:\n\n```javascript\nclient.setType('image');\n```"
        },
        {
          "id": "image-model",
          "label": "Model Selection",
          "icon": "cpu",
          "badge": "Step 4",
          "content": "# Model (Image)\n\nGebruik het image model:\n\n```javascript\nclient.setModel('flux');\n```"
        },
        {
          "id": "image-dimensions",
          "label": "Dimensions",
          "icon": "maximize-2",
          "badge": "Required",
          "content": "# Image Dimensions\n\n```javascript\nclient.setDimensions(1024, 1024);\n```"
        },
        {
          "id": "image-generate",
          "label": "Generate Image",
          "icon": "play-circle",
          "badge": "Core",
          "content": "# Generate Image\n\n```javascript\nconst blob = await client.generate('A futuristic city');\nconst url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\ndocument.querySelector('img').src = url;\n```"
        },
        {
          "id": "image-options",
          "label": "Optional Settings",
          "icon": "sliders",
          "badge": "Optional",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "seed-img",
              "label": "Seed",
              "icon": "shuffle",
              "content": "```javascript\nclient.setSeed(12345);\n```"
            },
            {
              "id": "timeout-img",
              "label": "Timeout",
              "icon": "clock",
              "content": "```javascript\nclient.setTimeout(30000);\n```"
            },
            {
              "id": "retry-img",
              "label": "Retry",
              "icon": "refresh-cw",
              "content": "```javascript\nclient.setRetry(true, 2, 1000);\n```"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
